      "notes": "Suggested use:  Contents may be sprinkled directly onto tongue or cold food, such as cereal or yogurt. If preferred, contents may be mixed with cold non-carbonated beverages, such as water or juice. Due to the nature of the product, consumption with hot foods or beverages should be avoided.\r\nFor best results use daily."
