    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Did you know 70% of your immune system is located in your gut? Our modern diet and daily 70% stresses throw off the balance of good bacteria, which can negatively impact our digestion and immunity. The key to a healthy immune system begins in the digestive tract and you need to take care of it on a daily basis. Nutrilite Balance Within Probiotic helps safely restore and maintain the natural level of good bacteria in the gut to support digestive health and your body's immunity.\r\n"
    },
    {
