      "notes": "1 stick pack, 1x a day"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Nutrilite Balance Within Probiotic supports a healthy microbiome.\r\nConvenient stick pack"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "6.3 Billion CFU guaranteed exclusive blend of 5 strains two clinically supported strains:\r\nHN019 \r\nNCFM \r\n1 g Natural prebiotic fiber "
